[{"_1":2,"_3":4},"root",{"_5":117},"routes/content-page",{"_5":6},"data",{"_7":8,"_9":10},"page",{"_15":42,"_21":34,"_43":44,"_17":45,"_46":47,"_48":49,"_50":51,"_19":52,"_53":54,"_9":55},"related",[11,12,13,14],{"_15":37,"_17":38,"_19":39,"_21":37},{"_15":31,"_17":32,"_19":33,"_21":34},{"_15":26,"_17":27,"_19":28,"_21":22},{"_15":16,"_17":18,"_19":20,"_21":22},"slug","accessibility","title","Accessibility statement","seo",{"_17":23,"_24":25},"area","legal","Accessibility statement | holidayfinder","description","holidayfinder aims to meet WCAG 2.2 level AA. How to use the site with a keyboard, screen reader or zoom, known limitations and how to contact us.","cancellation-policy","Cancellation policy",{"_17":29,"_24":30},"Cancellation policy | holidayfinder","How to cancel a holidayfinder booking, the charges for holidays, hotels, flights, cars, events and cruises, Flex, and how long refunds take.","book-with-confidence","Book with confidence",{"_17":35,"_24":36},"company","Book with confidence | holidayfinder","Financial protection for package holidays, secure payment, free cancellation on selected hotels, Flex and 24/7 support while you travel.","help","Help Centre",{"_17":40,"_24":41},"Help Centre and FAQ | holidayfinder","Answers about booking, payment plans, changes and cancellations, holidayfinder®Flex, baggage, transfers, car rental and special assistance.","contact-us","kind","contact","Contact us","lead","Real people, 24 hours a day, 7 days a week. Message us on WhatsApp, call or email — whichever suits you.","published","2026-06-15","updated","2026-10-30",{"_17":115,"_24":116},"sections",[56,57,58,59,60],[37,31,26,16],{"_61":105,"_17":106,"_73":107,"_64":108},{"_61":96,"_17":97,"_64":98},{"_61":86,"_17":87,"_64":88},{"_61":71,"_17":72,"_73":74,"_64":75},{"_61":62,"_17":63,"_64":65},"id","company-details","Company details","blocks",[66],{"_67":68,"_69":70},"type","paragraph","text","Our registered company name, number and VAT number are in the footer of every page. Please use WhatsApp, phone or email rather than post, so we can help you faster.","complaints","Making a complaint","intro","We’re sorry if something wasn’t right. Telling us quickly gives us the best chance of putting it right.",[76],{"_67":77,"_78":79,"_80":81},"list","ordered",true,"items",[82,83,84,85],"If you’re still on holiday, tell us and the hotel or supplier straight away so we can try to fix it there and then.","If you’re home, email us within 28 days of your return with your booking reference, what happened and any photos or receipts.","We acknowledge your complaint within 2 working days and aim to give you a full answer within 28 days.","If you’re not happy with our answer, we’ll tell you how to take it to an independent dispute resolution service.","during-your-trip","Help during your trip",[89,90],{"_67":68,"_69":95},{"_67":91,"_92":93,"_69":94},"callout","status","warning","In a medical or other emergency, call the local emergency number first (112 across the EU), then your travel insurer.","If something goes wrong while you’re away — a missed transfer, a problem with your room or a cancelled flight — contact us straight away by WhatsApp or phone, any time of day or night.","before-you-contact-us","Before you contact us",[99,100],{"_67":68,"_69":104},{"_67":91,"_92":101,"_17":102,"_69":103},"tip","Have your booking reference ready","It’s in your confirmation email and starts with HF. It helps us find your trip straight away.","Many questions are answered in our [Help Centre](/info/help). You can also see, change or cancel your trip yourself in [Manage my booking](/find-booking).","ways-to-reach-us","Ways to reach us","WhatsApp is usually the quickest. Our team answers on every channel around the clock.",[109],{"_67":44,"_110":111},"channels",[112,113,114],"whatsapp","phone","email","Contact us: 24/7 support | holidayfinder","Reach holidayfinder’s travel experts 24/7 by WhatsApp, phone or email. Help before you book, during your trip and afte